    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d529">

                <pb facs="0535" n="363" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg363"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/7757</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Panama</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Price</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-11-07T20:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 7, 1917, 8 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received November 8, 12.45
                        a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>National Assembly to-day unanimously passed resolution ratifying all steps of
                    belligerency heretofore taken and began favorable consideration of a bill
                    amplifying the powers given Panaman President by law, which is fourth enclosure
                    to my despatch 1271, February 27, last,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d529-f1"/>
                    including the control of exports among others, and the issuance of $500,000 of
                    bonds additional to the former authorization if need be.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Price</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
